OL,3,AElon Musk is a 'real genius', Putin
OL,4,Asays after satellite talks with SpaceX
OL,5,Aboss
OL,6,
OL,7,F"He's a genius, a real genius," Putin
OL,8,Fsaid of Musk, according to a
OL,9,Ftranslation of his remarks by the BBC.
OL,10,F"We are in close contact with our
OL,11,FAmerican partners, including Mr. Musk."
OL,13,FStarlink is part of Musk's company
OL,14,FSpaceX. The company did not respond to
OL,15,Fa request for comment.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/18
