OL,3,ACelebrity Traitors' Joe Lycett's
OL,4,Atribute to viral TikTok nan
OL,5,
OL,6,FCelebrity Traitors star and comedian
OL,7,FJoe Lycett has paid colourful tribute
OL,8,Fto the Welsh grandmother who went viral
OL,9,Fon TikTok after getting caught in shop
OL,10,Fshutters and being hoisted into the
OL,11,Fair.
OL,13,FThe moment Anne Hughes was left
OL,14,Fdangling 7ft (2.1 metres) in the air
OL,15,Fwas captured on CCTV - and viewed tens
OL,16,Fof millions of times on social media.
OL,18,FLycett, who is also an artist and a fan
OL,19,Fof the viral video, painted the
OL,20,Fincident for his art exhibition at the
OL,21,FBirmingham Museum and Art Gallery.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
